---
// Red "TBR" box placed before a paper's title: the paper is still to be read.
---

<tbr-mark title="To be read later">TBR</tbr-mark>

<style>
  tbr-mark {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-inline-end: 0.4em;
    padding-inline: 0.35em;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--red-9) 50%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--red-9) 15%, transparent);
    color: var(--red-11);
    font-size: 0.65em;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    vertical-align: 0.2em;
  }
</style>
